  "description": "KODIAK, Alaska -- A Coast Guard  Air Station Kodiak MH-60 Jayhawk helicopter crew conducted a medevac of a fisherman from the 150-foot fishing vessel Alaskan Leader 265 miles northwest of St. Paul Island about 11:50 a.m. Feb. 4, 2010. The helicopter successfully delivered Chad Smith, 40, to St. Paul where he later received a commercial medevac to Anchorage. U.S. Coast Guard video by Air Station Kodiak.",
